    "description": "Inclusive app update pause start in UTC (YYYY-MM-DDTHH:MM:SSZ, optionally with fractional seconds before Z, ignored at whole-second precision). A start alone pauses for 90 days. A valid end limits the interval to the earlier of PauseEnd and 90 days after PauseStart. An end earlier than the start is ignored. Values may be written independently.\r\n This setting is only available to Windows Insiders",
